"""refresh-models — probe /v1/models endpoints and update opencode.json provider blocks.

Commands:
  (no args)                    Refresh all enabled providers
  <server>                     Refresh one enabled provider by name
  --list                       List configured provider names
  enable                       Install the hourly systemd/launchd timer
  disable                      Remove the timer
  provider add                Add a provider through the shared Claudex registry
  provider enable <provider>   Enable a provider that has an API key
  provider disable <provider>  Disable a provider without deleting its key
  status                       Show timer and provider state
"""

